%% Loan Approval Activity
flowchart TD
Start([Start]) --> N0[Officer selects pending application]
N0 --> N1[Verify officer role and pending state]
N1 --> N2[Persist APPROVED decision, actor and timestamp]
N2 --> N3[Create associated loan]
N3 --> N4[Record LOAN_APPROVED blockchain event]
N4 --> N5[Show decision and chain status]
N5 --> End([End])
V -- No --> Err[Reject invalid transition; no unauthorized mutation]
V -- Yes --> N1
